 ## Air band and FM broadcast
 
+The derivative's AM gain-control candidate reduces receiver gain for strong signals and restores it for weaker
+ones. It needs no setting. Its effect on saturated audio still needs a comparison on the radio.
+
 Some radios also receive the aircraft band in AM and FM broadcast stations ([Radio reference](23-radios.md)). There is
 no mode to pick and no menu: the frequency decides.
 
